# Kept out of the published tree (#75). The public GitHub commit is
# byte-identical to the Gitea tag's tree (version-control.md section 5a), so
# anything tracked here is published. Agent context and working notes live in
# the local checkout only; internal/labstrings fails the build if any of these
# is tracked again.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.serena/

# Kotlin SDK build output. Gradle's test reports record the building machine's
# hostname, so a tracked copy publishes it (#75).
sdk/kotlin/build/
sdk/kotlin/.gradle/
sdk/kotlin/.kotlin/
